# OPC Development Standards

Follow AGENTS.md. Before coding: analyze architecture, propose design for non-trivial changes, work one module per sprint.

## Code Rules

- Production-grade runnable code only
- Config via environment variables
- Prompts in `/prompts/` (YAML preferred)
- AI output as structured JSON
- API under `/api/v1/` with unified response envelope
- DB changes via Alembic
- Background tasks via Celery

## Paths

- Backend API: `backend/app/api/v1/endpoints/`
- Frontend: `apps/web/src/`
- AI service: `services/ai/`
- Workers: `workers/tasks/`
- Shared TS types: `packages/shared-types/`
- Agent roles: `agents/roles/`

Run `make test` before claiming completion.
